{"name":"LeChuck’s Beard","hex":"#3c351f","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"beard","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Facial hair on the chin, cheeks, jaw and neck.","The cluster of small feathers at the base of the beak in some birds."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To grow hair on the chin and jaw.","To boldly and bravely oppose or confront, often to the chagrin of the one being bearded."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/beard"}],"entries":[{"title":"Beard","blocks":[{"text":"A beard is the hair that grows on the jaw, chin, upper lip, lower lip, cheeks, and neck of humans and some non-human animals. In humans, beards are most common among pubescent and adult males, though some women also develop them in a condition called hirsutism."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/36/Photography-wallpaper-facial-hair-man-beard-chin-moustache-human-elder-portrait-1453095.jpg/330px-Photography-wallpaper-facial-hair-man-beard-chin-moustache-human-elder-portrait-1453095.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Beard","wikidata":"Q42804"},{"title":"Monkey Island","blocks":[{"text":"Monkey Island is a series of adventure games. The first four games were produced and published by LucasArts, earlier known as Lucasfilm Games. The fifth was developed by Telltale Games with LucasArts, while the sixth was developed by Terrible Toybox with Lucasfilm Games and Devolver Digital."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/f/f0/Monkey_Island_Logo.svg/330px-Monkey_Island_Logo.svg.png?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Monkey_Island","wikidata":"Q533239"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d3/Baerte_ohne_text.jpg/500px-Baerte_ohne_text.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","sr